BoijSoederberg -- Betti diagram routines
****************************************

Description
===========

BoijSoederberg is a package designed to help with the investigation of the
Boij-Soederberg conjectures and theorems.  For the definitions and conjectures,
see math.AC/0611081, "Graded Betti numbers of Cohen-Macaulay modules and the
Multiplicity conjecture", by Mats Boij, Jonas Soederberg.


Manipulation of Betti diagrams
==============================

  * *note mat2betti: mat2betti_lpMatrix_cmZZ_rp, -- matrix to Betti diagram
  * matrix(BettiTally,ZZ,ZZ) (missing documentation)
  * *note lowestDegrees: lowestDegrees_lpBettiTally_rp, -- list of lowest
    degree shifts
  * *note highestDegrees: highestDegrees_lpBettiTally_rp, -- list of highest
    degree shifts
  * *note BettiTally: (Macaulay2Doc)BettiTally, -- the class of all Betti
    tallies
  * *note makeCI: makeCI, -- Make the Betti diagram of a complete intersection
    ideal

