CohomologyTally -- cohomology table
***********************************

Description
===========

A CohomologyTally is designed to hold cohomology dimensions h^i(E(d-i)) in the
i-th row and the d-th column of the table, for some sheaf or vector bundle E on
P^n.  The initial motivation was to provide a nice visual display of this
information.  However, some computations involving CohomologyTally are
implemented.

Functions and methods returning a Cohomology tally:
===================================================

  * "pureCohomologyTable" -- see *note pureCohomologyTable(List,ZZ,ZZ):
    pureCohomologyTable_lpList_cmZZ_cmZZ_rp, -- pure cohomology table given
    zeros of Hilbert polynomial

