  * Usage: 
        facetEquation(L,i,lodeg,hideg)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the degree sequence, a strictly
        ascending list of integers
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, an index in range 0..#L-2, such
        that L_(i+1) == L_i + 2
